    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Okta is a publicly traded identity security company (NASDAQ: OKTA, CIK 0001660134) that describes itself as placing identity at the heart of business security and growth. Its two core platforms, Okta and Auth0, are designed to provide secure access, authentication, and automation for employees, customers, and what the company refers to as non-human identities.\n\nOn the AI side, Okta offers a product called Okta AI, which the company categorizes under Security and Identity AI. It encompasses identity-based risk scoring, risk-based authentication, privileged access controls, and identity threat detection, all built on top of the broader Okta and Auth0 platform infrastructure. The company positions these capabilities as extensible for workforce, customer, and machine-to-machine identity use cases.\n\nNo litigation, MCP server registrations, or SEC filings beyond the basic company registration appear in the available data.",
